### Fingerprint

`rbfp-f2d60eb4e533` (error code `unreachable`, finding `node-dead`, site `src/relish/wtf/diagnose.rs::nodes`; seen on 0.2.7)

### Version

relish 0.2.7, commit a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8f9012345678, source as committed, aarch64-apple-darwin, formats protocol 57 / state 74

### Fix status

Fixed in 0.2.8, newer than the 0.2.7 this ran: upgrading may be all that's needed.

### What happened

relish agent diagnose said node-1 was dead; curl https://ipv4-1:9117 answered

Expected: no node-dead finding while the node answers

### Reproducer

```shell
relish fault partition node-1 --one-way, then relish agent diagnose
```

