### Suspected source

`src/relish/wtf/diagnose.rs::nodes`, at https://github.com/reliaburger/reliaburger/blob/a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8f9012345678/src/relish/wtf/diagnose.rs

### Patch

```diff
--- a/src/relish/logs.rs
+++ b/src/relish/logs.rs
@@ -1,3 +1,3 @@
-    let since = None;
+    let since = Some(window);
 // test talks to 192.0.2.1 with rbrg_[redacted]
```

### What was not tested

a cluster with more than two nodes

### How this should have been caught

A Smoker fault we don't inject yet: a one-way partition fault between two nodes, which Smoker can't inject yet

